@prefix hpc: <http://example.org/hpc#>
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Job a owl:Class.
hpc:Partition a owl:Class.
hpc:Node a owl:Class.
hpc:Cpu a owl:Class.
hpc:Memory a owl:Class.
hpc:Tmpdisk a owl:Class.
hpc:state a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:user a owl:DatatypeProperty.
hpc:time a owl:DatatypeProperty.
hpc:nodes a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:nodelist a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:reason a owl:DatatypeProperty.
hpc:Cpus rdfs:range xsd:non
